{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016kvaC29A35n5wRb7BCj9HP","type":"tool_result","content":"# kubectl debug Reference\n\n**Attribution:** Kubernetes Documentation (CC BY 4.0)\n\n## Synopsis\n\n```\nkubectl debug (POD | TYPE[[.VERSION].GROUP]/NAME) [ -- COMMAND [args...] ]\n```\n\n## Description\n\nThe `kubectl debug` command enables troubleshooting of cluster resources through interactive debugging containers. It automates common debugging tasks for cluster objects, defaulting to Pods when no resource is specified.\n\nActions vary by resource type:\n- **Workload:** Create a modified Pod copy (e.g., updated image tag) or add ephemeral debugging containers to running Pods\n- **Node:** Launch a new Pod accessing the node's host namespaces and filesystem\n\n**Note:** Non-root Pod configurations may limit certain debug profile capabilities.\n\n## Examples\n\n```\n# Interactive debugging session in pod mypod\nkubectl debug mypod -it --image=busybox\n\n# Debug from file (requires EphemeralContainers enabled)\nkubectl debug -f pod.yaml -it --image=busybox\n\n# Named debug container with custom image\nkubectl debug --image=myproj/debug-tools -c debugger mypod\n\n# Create copy with debug container\nkubectl debug mypod -it --image=busybox --copy-to=my-debugger\n\n# Copy with modified container command\nkubectl debug mypod -it --copy-to=my-debugger --container=mycontainer -- sh\n\n# Copy with all images changed to busybox\nkubectl debug mypod --copy-to=my-debugger --set-image=*=busybox\n\n# Copy with debug container and modified images\nkubectl debug mypod -it --copy-to=my-debugger --image=debian --set-image=app=app:debug,sidecar=sidecar:debug\n\n# Node debugging with host access\nkubectl debug node/mynode -it --image=busybox\n```\n\n## Key Flags & Options\n\n| Flag | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| `--profile string` | \"Options are 'general', 'baseline', 'restricted', 'netadmin' or 'sysadmin'. Defaults to 'general'\" |\n| `--image string` | Container image to use for debug container |\n| `--container` / `-c string` | Container name to use for debug container |\n| `--copy-to string` | Create a copy of the target Pod with this name |\n| `--target string` | \"When using an ephemeral container, target processes in this container name\" |\n| `--set-image stringToString` | \"When used with '--copy-to', a list of name=image pairs for changing container images\" |\n| `--share-processes` | \"When used with '--copy-to', enable process namespace sharing in the copy\" (Default: true) |\n| `--replace` | \"When used with '--copy-to', delete the original Pod\" |\n| `--attach` | \"If true, wait for the container to start running, and then attach as if 'kubectl attach ...' were called\" |\n| `--custom string` | \"Path to a JSON or YAML file containing a partial container spec to customize built-in debug profiles\" |\n| `-i, --stdin` | Keep stdin open on the container(s) in the pod |\n| `-t, --tty` | Allocate a TTY for the debugging container |"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2b156e7c-433e-416d-a6d5-5879b6834809","uuid":"f07e4996-41f1-486b-a1a1-0d31c89593ef","timestamp":"2026-08-31T11:50:48.939Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":16712,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# kubectl debug Reference\n\n**Attribution:** Kubernetes Documentation (CC BY 4.0)\n\n## Synopsis\n\n```\nkubectl debug (POD | TYPE[[.VERSION].GROUP]/NAME) [ -- COMMAND [args...] ]\n```\n\n## Description\n\nThe `kubectl debug` command enables troubleshooting of cluster resources through interactive debugging containers. It automates common debugging tasks for cluster objects, defaulting to Pods when no resource is specified.\n\nActions vary by resource type:\n- **Workload:** Create a modified Pod copy (e.g., updated image tag) or add ephemeral debugging containers to running Pods\n- **Node:** Launch a new Pod accessing the node's host namespaces and filesystem\n\n**Note:** Non-root Pod configurations may limit certain debug profile capabilities.\n\n## Examples\n\n```\n# Interactive debugging session in pod mypod\nkubectl debug mypod -it --image=busybox\n\n# Debug from file (requires EphemeralContainers enabled)\nkubectl debug -f pod.yaml -it --image=busybox\n\n# Named debug container with custom image\nkubectl debug --image=myproj/debug-tools -c debugger mypod\n\n# Create copy with debug container\nkubectl debug mypod -it --image=busybox --copy-to=my-debugger\n\n# Copy with modified container command\nkubectl debug mypod -it --copy-to=my-debugger --container=mycontainer -- sh\n\n# Copy with all images changed to busybox\nkubectl debug mypod --copy-to=my-debugger --set-image=*=busybox\n\n# Copy with debug container and modified images\nkubectl debug mypod -it --copy-to=my-debugger --image=debian --set-image=app=app:debug,sidecar=sidecar:debug\n\n# Node debugging with host access\nkubectl debug node/mynode -it --image=busybox\n```\n\n## Key Flags & Options\n\n| Flag | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| `--profile string` | \"Options are 'general', 'baseline', 'restricted', 'netadmin' or 'sysadmin'. Defaults to 'general'\" |\n| `--image string` | Container image to use for debug container |\n| `--container` / `-c string` | Container name to use for debug container |\n| `--copy-to string` | Create a copy of the target Pod with this name |\n| `--target string` | \"When using an ephemeral container, target processes in this container name\" |\n| `--set-image stringToString` | \"When used with '--copy-to', a list of name=image pairs for changing container images\" |\n| `--share-processes` | \"When used with '--copy-to', enable process namespace sharing in the copy\" (Default: true) |\n| `--replace` | \"When used with '--copy-to', delete the original Pod\" |\n| `--attach` | \"If true, wait for the container to start running, and then attach as if 'kubectl attach ...' were called\" |\n| `--custom string` | \"Path to a JSON or YAML file containing a partial container spec to customize built-in debug profiles\" |\n| `-i, --stdin` | Keep stdin open on the container(s) in the pod |\n| `-t, --tty` | Allocate a TTY for the debugging container |","durationMs":10707,"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/main/content/en/docs/reference/kubectl/generated/kubectl_debug/_index.md"}}
